       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAINSTATIC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-NUMBER PIC 9(5) VALUE 30000.
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           CALL "BONUS-CALC"
               USING WS-NUMBER WS-RESULT.

           DISPLAY "BONUS: " WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.
           